{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119880/extras/CoreFeatures_ProjectYoYo.gif?t=1740968607\" /><br><strong>Phantom Recall</strong> (Project Yo-Yo) delivers an exhilarating arcade experience, thrusting you into a frenetic arena FPS where every move counts. Master the art of repurposing your lines of fire on the fly amidst a relentless bullet hell to ascend the ranks and dominate the brutal leaderboard.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Engage in dynamic <strong>Shoot</strong>, and <strong>Recall </strong>mechanics with your YoYo.<br></li><li>Charge up your YoYo's damage by striking more enemies.<br></li><li>Splash your flying YoYo to <strong>Push</strong> enemies to your advantage.<br></li><li>Utilize precise recalls to repurpose your lines of fire and turn the tide of battle.<br></li><li>Unleash <strong>Ultimate YoYos</strong> to flood the arena and seize control in bullet time.<br></li><li>Rise through the ranks and establish your dominance on the <strong>Global Leaderboard</strong>.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2119880?t=1740968607","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119880/0533c9164b685f7b0570506e9d27e7247315c963/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740968607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119880/aca36d6b9aa5268cceb480d956740593c7dacc08/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740968607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119880/aca36d6b9aa5268cceb480d956740593c7dacc08/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740968607","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><img class=\"bb